1
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,070
Gold dust, gold dust

2
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,580
Walk with me now

3
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,200
I was runnin' laps in a borrowed crown

4
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:28,280
Every mirror in my room kept lettin' me down

5
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,960
Then grace kicked the door like a marching band

6
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:36,380
Put a lamp in my chest and a map in my hand

7
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:42,030
Now I'm movin' different, I'm walkin' tall

8
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,490
Got a King on my side and He covers it all

9
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:46,910
No hype, no hustle, no trying to impress

10
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:49,300
I'm a mess made new, call it holy finesse

11
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,740
Can you hear that knock? (knock knock)

12
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,250
Can you feel that drop? (drop drop)

13
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,730
Gold dust on my feet, everywhere I go

14
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:59,570
Jesus in the street, let the whole block know

15
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:01,930
Mud to the gold, He flipped my soul

16
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:04,480
Say His name, say it loud

17
00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:06,470
Gold dust on my feet, I can't hide that glow

18
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:09,380
Shake the ground with the beat, let the whole world know

19
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,790
Mud to the gold, He flipped my soul

20
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:15,220
Say His name, say it loud (JESUS!)

21
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,090
Mama prayed late with the porch light on

22
00:01:17,140 --> 00:01:19,230
Pops worked double, never sang a song

23
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:21,750
But I saw love in the callus and the tired eyes

24
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:24,430
So I honor them both every time I rise

25
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,410
Neighbor down the road, yeah, I'm lookin' out

26
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:29,130
Fill your cup up first, then I pour it out

27
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:31,590
Little brother watchin', so I'm walkin' right

28
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:34,740
I'm a candle in the window on a long dark night

29
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,550
Nail-scarred hands pulled me out the pit

30
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:43,890
Wrote my name where the grave can't quit

31
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:46,370
Every chain on the floor, every door swung wide

32
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:49,030
Ain't nothin' gonna steal what He put inside

33
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:50,150
(Clap!) Ain't nothin'

34
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,390
(Clap!) Ain't nothin'

35
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,450
(Clap!) Ain't nothin'

36
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,720
Gonna steal this joy!

37
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:59,550
Gold dust on my feet, everywhere I go

38
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:04,980
Jesus in the street, let the whole block know

39
00:02:05,820 --> 00:02:08,560
Mud to the gold, He flipped my soul

40
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:14,060
Say His name, say it loud (JESUS!)

41
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:21,880
Gold dust, gold dust

42
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,880
Mud to the gold

43
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:34,800
Say His name

